  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b29894440b8f4b54185915f65552c667, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSystem
  dialogueText: {fileID: 0}
  panel: {fileID: 0}
  delayBetweenLines: 2
  typingSpeed: 0.02
  tutorialLines:
  - Welcome to Blackjack...
  - I will be your dealer for tonight.
  - The stakes are your survival.
  - Let me recap the basics...
  - Your goal is 21.
  - Do not go over 21.
  - Number cards hold their face value.
  - Kings, Queens, and Jacks count as 10.
  - Aces count as 1 or 11.
  - Beat my total to win the round.
  - Bust past 21 and you lose.
  - Bought items alter the decks.
  - 'Remember: Soon we will not play by standard rules alone.'
  - Let's get started...
  splitTutorialLines:
  - Let me remind you the rules for Splitting.
  - When you hold two cards of equal value...
  - You can split them into two separate hands.
  - Another bet is placed equal to your first bet.
  - Play the first hand to completion.
  - Then play your next hand.
  - You can split up to 3 times, if money allows.
  - Double your risk, win twice the money.
  - Use your right hand to gesture a split.
  doubleDownTutorialLines:
  - Let me remind you the rules for Doubling Down.
  - When you hold two cards only...
  - You can double down to double your current bet.
  - I deal you exactly one more card...
  - And your turn ends immediately.
  - Win big or lose everything.
  - Use your left hand to gesture a double down.
  powerballTutorialLines:
  - The Powerball event! A classic.
  - You will get three random numbers.
  - They will be on the screen behind me...
  - ... so your little head can keep track.
  - Finish your turn with one of those three scores.
  - You will have to get all of them eventually.
  - Does it apply to splitting? Guess.
  addCardsTutorialLines:
  - Throw the darts at the cards you want to copy.
  - You can see on each dart how many copies it creates.
  lowMoneyTaunts:
  - Careful now...
  betLostTaunts:
  - That must've hurt.
  - Ouch...
  - Too bad...
  - What a waste...
  dealerBlackjackTaunts:
  - Not a chance...
  dealerWinsByOneTaunts:
  - Not good enough...
  - Almost...
  playerBlackjackTaunts:
  - Lucky...
  tieTaunts:
  - Not so fast...
  turnLimitTaunts:
  - A bit too slow.
  - Time's up.
  - I've seen enough.
  copyOptionTaunts:
  - That one? Hm...
  - It's your choice I suppose.
  - It makes sense for you to choose that.
  powerballWinTaunts:
  - What's that? You got all of them?
  - So you got them all.
  - It's over. That didn't last too long...
  powerballGenerateTaunts:
  - Don't you worry. Powerball is not done yet.
  - See that? You just got new powerball numbers!
  trustFundTaunts: []
  luckyCoinFlip:
  - Lucky... You get half off on items.
  - Lucky, but only for next round.
  unluckyCoinFlip:
  - Very sad, but you'll manage.
  - Hm... unlucky. But I do have a business to maintain.
  chooseKeepsakeTaunts:
  - Choose one or refuse. I don't care.
  forcedAllInnTaunts:
  - LET IT RIDE!!!
  dealerHalvesCardsTaunts:
  - Your cards are worthless or almost
  dealerRemovesItemTaunts:
  - No more item tehe
  dealerShuffleTaunts:
  - Those cards where too good for you
  cashOutText:
  - Go big or go home?
